{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0574_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "4f89363be171aba077eed5b17d0468a19381d95f0b8f24043ed5865f7e547d54", "ja": "……本当に分かってますか？", "zh": "……你真的明白了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0574_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d7dc2c584dab1c79c1051244bd1990da52c55f4f5fffd94bd0097c76a51bd1ca", "ja": "もちろん！", "zh": "那当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0574_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "676a5072227b67c1f16672fe535e2b4f99361540888c87be53cd6d95a8828246", "ja": "……。とにかく、この衣装には、\n星が輝く夜空みたいな雰囲気が合うかなって。", "zh": "……。总之，我觉得这套服装\n可能比较适合繁星闪烁的夜空那样的氛围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0574_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "00eee815bda2c287ae56b5ebdecf2b1f7083bc1da9d3f9bb169ee71131559d27", "ja": "綺麗なドレスですから、動きの激しいダンスとか、\nそういう見せ方とは、変わってきますけど。", "zh": "因为是漂亮的礼服，所以和那种动作幅度很大的舞蹈之类的表现方式，会有所不同，不过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
